 - --version / -V (prints bundled version text)
 - -e PATTERN (can be used multiple times)
 - -f FILE (read patterns from file)
 - reading files or stdin
 - prints matching lines; when multiple paths given, prefix with path:
Exit codes: 0 matches found, 1 no matches, 2 on error
"""
import sys, re, os

HELP_TEXT = r"""
"""

VERSION_TEXT = r"""
ripgrep 14.1.1 (rev 719e15af5e)

features:-pcre2
simd(compile):+SSE2,-SSSE3,-AVX2
simd(runtime):+SSE2,+SSSE3,+AVX2

PCRE2 is not available in this build of ripgrep.
